    "note": "MEASURE ONLY, like every other block here. The shipped same-game rho (data/parlay_backtest.json, 2023-25) is scored against 2026 outcomes -- RC-N5's precondition for trusting the chained joint -- and no rho measured here is adopted, written back or allowed to reach a leg. A verdict needs the 90% CI to exclude 0 and at least min_n pairs; below that the numbers are printed and the verdict is 'insufficient'."
